   <rdf:Alt>
    <rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>UNITED STATES - OCTOBER 31 (FILE): John King, Georgia&#39;s insurance and safety fire commissioner, speaks during a campaign event for Sen. Kelly Loeffler, R-Ga., who is running for reelection, at J.D.â€™s on the Lake in Canton, Ga., on Saturday, October 31, 2020. Marjorie Taylor Greene, Republican nominee for Georgia&#39;s 14th Congressional District, also attended. (Photo By Tom Williams/CQ Roll Call)</rdf:li>
   </rdf:Alt>
